---
layout: layouts/piece.njk
title: "The Café — Survey card (2 per letter sheet)"
canvasW: "11in"
canvasH: "8.5in"
pageSize: "11in 8.5in"
pageCss: "/assets/css/survey-card.css"

tags: studio
studioTitle: "Survey card — paper"
studioCategory: "Signs"
studioSize: "11 × 8.5 in landscape · two 5.5 × 8.5 cards, cut in half · one ink"
studioNote: "The /survey questions on paper, for anyone who'd rather not use a phone. Two cards per letter sheet: print landscape at 100%, cut on the dashed line. Black ink only, for the cafe's printer. Same questions as the web page (src/_data/survey.json), so the answers can be tallied together."
studioW: 1056
studioH: 816
studioOrder: 36
---
{#- Two identical cards side by side, so one letter sheet makes two and
    the cut is a single straight line. Everything is set in black: this is
    printed on the cafe's black-only printer and filled in with a pen, so
    circles to mark and ruled lines to write on, nothing in colour. -#}
{%- macro card() %}
<section class="card">
    <header class="card-head">
        <h1 class="p-display card-name">{{ site.name }}</h1>
        <p class="p-display-italic card-title">How did we do?</p>
        <p class="p-body card-intro">Circle one for each. Every question is optional.</p>
    </header>

    <table class="card-rates">
        <thead>
            <tr><th></th>{% for opt in survey.scale %}<th>{{ opt }}</th>{% endfor %}</tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            {%- for q in survey.ratings %}
            <tr><th scope="row">{{ q.label }}</th>{% for opt in survey.scale %}<td><span class="o"></span></td>{% endfor %}</tr>
            {%- endfor %}
        </tbody>
    </table>

    {%- for q in survey.choices %}
    <div class="card-q">
        <p class="card-label">{{ q.label }}</p>
        <p class="card-opts">{% for opt in q.options %}<span class="opt"><span class="o"></span>{{ opt }}</span>{% endfor %}</p>
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}

    {%- for q in survey.open %}
    <div class="card-q">
        <p class="card-label">{{ q.label }}</p>
        <div class="card-lines"><span></span><span></span></div>
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}

    <div class="card-q card-reply">
        <p class="card-label">Want us to get back to you? Name and phone or email:</p>
        <div class="card-lines"><span></span></div>
    </div>

    <p class="card-foot">Thank you! Hand it back at the counter.</p>
</section>
{%- endmacro %}
<div class="canvas survey-sheet">
    {{ card() }}
    <div class="cut" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    {{ card() }}
</div>
